ISO-10303-21;
/* Tsh091: OPEN_SHELL IS wired with 2 ADVANCED_FACEs; Face A IS a valid 1x1 unit quad at x=0..1, y=0..1; Face B (sliver) IS wired: all 4 VERTEX_POINTs at (2,0,0); all EDGE_CURVEs of Face B IS zero-length — IS the mechanism; degenerate sliver face IS directly embedded in OPEN_SHELL topology; zero-area sliver alongside valid face IS the sliver-detection mechanism; ShapeUpgrade_ShellSewing.Apply lacks degenerate-face check; includes sliver in output shell causing downstream failures; fix: detect and reject zero-area faces before sewing in Apply */
